# Welcome to MahaDevan's OS (live session)
#
#   Install:  click "Install MahaDevan's OS" on the desktop, or run
#               sudo -E calamares
#
#   Live user: liveuser   password: live   (sudo without password)
#   This account exists ONLY in the live session. The installer creates your
#   real account and removes every live-only artefact afterwards.
#
#   If Hyprland fails to start, pick the "labwc" session in SDDM, or reboot and
#   choose "MahaDevan's OS (safe graphics)" in the boot menu.
#
#   Nothing is written to your disks until you confirm the target device in the
#   installer.
